// A unit separator inside a suggestion is a space.
// A backspace stays a backspace. The ranker is unchanged.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE unit ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG unit law

IMPULSE unit 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "unit" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
